      "Caches glyph masks and metrics only; every frame still executes layout and resolves theme, live status and animation clock.",
      "Cached private L masks use the same Pillow draw_bitmap route as uncached draw.text; antialiasing stays byte identical.",
      "All prior direct draw.text sites preserve their chosen font and anchor; _text and _text_width continue resolving CJK fallback before cache keys.",
      "Cache keys retain actual font and native font core identity, preventing id reuse and font-core replacement staleness.",
      "Variable-font axes are excluded; default/non-FreeType, multiline, overlong strings, non-L fontmode, non-RGB draw, fractional coordinates preserve original paths.",
      "No controller, GPIO, queue, lock timer, framebuffer ordering or Python/native transport changes.",
      "256 masks each at most240x48 provide under3MiB of retained grayscale pixels; metrics512 and variation probes32 bounded separately. Native font object/entry metadata overhead is additional.",
      "Layout/raster exceptions remain visible; caches do not suppress errors. Invalid anchors and missing-font fallback matched frozen baseline.",
      "No full-frame cache or mutable output sharing; output frames and previews continue to render independently."
